<title>UK: Westpac sets 350 million mark two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Westpac sets 350 million mark two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTPAC BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    04.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -5 B.P.   PAY DATE    04.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.96     FULL FEES   0.10</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 REOFFER    99.96</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/GB/NZ/AU/DE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
